Snare-Oh can generate a steady supply of the bandages that make up his body.<ref name="SoDS"/> He can extend their length to approximately 30 feet{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = accard}} and control their movement for various purposes, such as wrapping, grappling, lifting, and moving around objects and opponents. He can also detach his bandages after wrapping them around someone, to become a permanent restraint.<ref name="BIM"/>

The strength of each individual bandage is powerful enough to punch holes in the ground and restrain  [[Fourmungousaur]], who has the combined strength of both [[Four Arms (Classic)|Four Arms]] and [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]],<ref name="ATTWN">''[[And Then There Were None]]''</ref> and they are sharp enough to cut through vines grown by a [[Florauna (Classic)|Florauna's]] fruit-like pods, as demonstrated by [[Kuphulu]].<ref name="RMP">''[[Rad Monster Party]]''</ref> Snare-Oh can also use his bandages to create a sturdy wall.<ref name="RtF">''[[Return to Forever]]''</ref> 

Being composed of bandages, Snare-Oh can reshape his body at will. This allows him to split himself apart to dodge attacks and reform to counter-attack.<ref name="BIM" /> Additionally, by reducing himself down to a few bandages, Snare-Oh can fly around and slip through extremely tight spaces or small openings. This allows him to escape various traps or maneuver through cramped areas.<ref name="BIM" />

Snare-Oh can regenerate himself and recover almost instantly from many types of injuries, such as being torn into confetti by a large fan, as demonstrated by the [[Mummy]].<ref name="UW">''[[Under Wraps]]''</ref>

Snare-Oh can survive in the vacuum of space, as demonstrated by the Mummy.<ref name="BAotD" />

Despite being made of bandages, Snare-Oh is immune to being moistened and having his mobility reduced by water. As such, he can survive underwater.<ref name="SoDS" />

Snare-Oh is immune to the effects of [[Corrodium]] and can see in the dark,{{Refn|[[:File:All Anur System Aliens Can See in the Dark.png]]|group = DJW}} the former of which has been demonstrated by the [[Mummy]].<ref name="UW" /><ref name="BAotD">''[[Be Afraid of the Dark]]''</ref> Snare-Oh can also block out Corrodium radiation with his bandages, allowing him to carry the dangerous crystal inside his body without irradiating anything nearby, as demonstrated by the Mummy.<ref name="UW" /><ref name="BAotD" />

Snare-Oh has a bioluminescent body and glowing eyes.<ref>''[[Ken 10]]''</ref>

Snare-Oh can completely unravel his body to create a pile of bandages to cushion a landing. His face separates from the rest of the bandages in the process.<ref name="SoDS" />

By whipping his tendrils around all at once, Snare-Oh can create a tornado attack.{{Refn|group = Bandai|name = accard}}

==Weaknesses==
Snare-Oh can be tangled up in his own bandages, as demonstrated with Kuphulu.<ref name="RMP" />

Snare-Oh is vulnerable to intense heat.{{Refn|[[:File:The Return Pop-up (16).png]]|group = pop-up}}<ref name="TR"/>

Snare-Oh can be controlled and hypnotized by [[Vladat|Vladats]] via their [[Corruptura|Corrupturas]], as demonstrated with Kuphulu and many other [[Thep Khufan]] residents of [[Anur Transyl]].<ref name="TVSB">''[[The Vampire Strikes Back]]''</ref>

Snare-Oh can be scared by [[Toepick]]'s [[Toepick's Species|species]].{{Refn|[[:File:Toepick Can Scare Anur System Aliens.png]]|group = DJW}}

==History==
===Ben 10=== 
*In ''[[Under Wraps]]'', Snare-Oh was added to the active playlist when the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] "sampled" the [[Mummy]]'s DNA.{{Refn|group=note|name=donor}}
*Snare-Oh first appeared in ''[[The Return]]'', where he battled the [[Werewolf]] until the latter escaped.

===Alien Force=== 
*Snare-Oh was locked by the Omnitrix's reconfiguration in ''[[Ben 10 Returns: Part 1]]''.

===Ultimate Alien===
*In ''[[Ben 10,000 Returns]]'', Snare-Oh was re-unlocked by [[Ben 10,000 (Ultimate Alien)|Ben 10,000]].

===Omniverse=== 
*In ''[[The Frogs of War: Part 1]]'', Snare-Oh grappled onto an [[Incursean (Classic)|Incursean]] space fighter before the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]]'s randomizer function made him switch into [[Rath (Classic)|Rath]].
*In ''[[Return to Forever]]'', Snare-Oh sent a [[Pyroxovore]] herd back to their holding pens.
*In ''[[Bengeance is Mine]]'', Snare-Oh battled [[Psyphon]] and the [[Squid Monster]]s until he trapped them.
*In ''[[The Secret of Dos Santos]]'', Snare-Oh saved [[Rook Blonko|Rook]] and [[Kai Green|Kai]] from falling before fighting a [[Jungle Guardian]].

===[[Original Future Timeline]]=== 
*In ''[[Ken 10]]'', Snare-Oh got [[Ken Tennyson (Original)|Ken]] out of a vent that he hid in while he fought [[Kevin 11]].

===[[No Watch Timeline]]===
*In ''[[And Then There Were None]]'', [[Benzarro]] as Snare-Oh battled [[Fourmungousaur]] and tossed [[Build-A-Guy]] into the blast of the [[Chronosapien Time Bomb]].

