==Etymology==
His placeholder name, Benmummy, is a combination of the words "Ben" and "mummy".

Snare-Oh's name comes from "snare", meaning to tie up or even to restrain someone or something, which alludes to his ability to do so, and the "-oh" is derived from "[[Wikipedia:Pharaoh|pharaoh]]", a word for an [[Wikipedia:Egypt|Egyptian]] king, referencing his appearance.

==Trivia==
*Snare-Oh is one of four aliens whose working name had [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s name in it, the other three being [[Blitzwolfer]], [[Frankenstrike]], and [[Nanomech]].
**In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', the name "Benmummy" was replaced with Snare-Oh.
*Like Frankenstrike, [[Arctiguana]], [[Buzzshock (Classic)|Buzzshock]], and [[Upchuck|Murk Upchuck]], Snare-Oh appeared in '''Omniverse''', but he did not appear in ''[[A New Dawn]]''.
*Snare-Oh's '''Original Series''' design was made by [[Thomas N. Perkins IV]],{{Refn|[[:File:Tom Designed S3 & S4 Characters.png]]|group = TNP}} while his '''Omniverse''' design was made by [[Chap Yaep]] based on [[Derrick J. Wyatt|Derrick J. Wyatt's]] roughs.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Blitzwolfer and Snare-Oh Designers.PNG]]|group = DJW}}
*At some point late in production for Season 3 of the '''Original Series''', Snare-Oh's Omnitrix symbol was intended to be on his left wrist rather than his left shoulder.{{Refn|[[:File:Snare-Oh Omnitrix Symbol.png]]|group = ca}}
*Had he appeared in '''Omniverse''' flashbacks, 11-year-old Snare-Oh would have resembled his appearance in the '''Original Series'''.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Young Snare-Oh.png]]|group = DJW}}
**In the '''Omniverse''' intro used from Arc 4 onwards, 11-year-old Snare-Oh is incorrectly designed to look the same as his 16-year-old self.
*Although he has never trained himself to do so, Snare-Oh can perform [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] similar to Egyptian curses.{{Refn|[[:File:Thep Khufans Can Learn Magic.png]]|group = DJW}} However, Ben cannot stay transformed as Snare-Oh long enough to learn it without Master Control.{{Refn|[[:File:Terraspin and Snare-Oh Cannot Learn Magic.png]]|group = DJW}}

